  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Figure 6, 'Continuity of Care scenario: Online Digital use case (UC003)'. The Figure 3 workflow with one path highlighted: arrival (1), vaccination (2), paper recording (3) giving Point A; a digital health solution is at the care site and the vaccinator records the data in it (4); the site has Internet connectivity, so the record goes directly to Point B, available in digital form. Step 5 by data entry personnel is greyed out.",
